# Finder / editor auto-duplicates. macOS Finder creates "<name> 2.<ext>"
# when paste-copying into a directory that already has the same name;
# editor crashes can leave "<name>.<ext>.tmp.<pid>.<hex>" files behind.
# These have shadowed a real workflow file in CI before (a stale
# "build 2.yml" with rustc 1.85.0 ran instead of build.yml's 1.90.0 pin).
**/* 2.yml
**/* 2.rs
**/* 2.ts
**/* 2.tsx
**/*.yml.tmp.*
**/*.rs.tmp.*
